   "dataset_title": "Effect of CBP/P300 inhibition on extravillous trophoblast differentiation",
   "design": "TSCs were seeded either in TSC medium or in EVT\u2011A medium, with or without 1\u202f\u00b5M A\u2011485 or 3\u202f\u00b5M CPI. On day 3, TSCs were collected for RNA isolation, while EVTs were refreshed with EVT\u2011B medium, again with or without 1\u202f\u00b5M A\u2011485 or 3\u202f\u00b5M CPI. EVTs were harvested for RNA isolation on day 5. A detailed culture protocol is provided in van Voorden et\u202fal.,\u202f2023 (DOI:\u202f10.1073/pnas.2217405120).  The samples included in the current sequence submission are the EVTs cultured in the presence of inhibitor. The corresponding TSCs and EVTs grown without inhibitor are available under GEO accession GSE282356. TSC samples: GSM8641822, GSM8641824, and GSM8641834. EVT samples: GSM8641823 and GSM8641829.",
